    - target: {fileID: 200006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab3e6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteBody
      value: "He locked himself in Mechatronics... but whatever came out isn't him
        anymore.\n\nThe lab high-bay lights blinded it, so it smashed the electrical
        relays. If you're trapped, check the optics bay in Mechatronics and the EC
        Lab across the hall.\n\nThe parts to re-wire the UV blaster are scattered
        between them. Slide the bolt on the restroom door\u2014it can't break through
        the deadbolt."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 200006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab3e6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteTitle
      value: Emergency Maintenance Note
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 200006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab3e6, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _locationFound
      value: Floor 02 - Dual-Gender Restroom
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
