      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 300006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab303, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteBody
      value: "September 19 \u2014 22:15 HRS\n\nThe shadow wavelength has integrated
        with my cellular structure. I can feel it warping my consciousness.\n\nTo
        anyone reading this: DO NOT LET THE LIGHT DIE. The darkness accelerates the
        transformation.\n\nI've dismantled the coherent photonic emitter across the
        lab:\n\u2022 Focusing Lens on the optics bench\n\u2022 Battery Pack in the
        power bay\n\u2022 Amplifier Circuit on the soldering table\n\u2022 Weapon
        Housing by the 3D prototyping bay\n\nAdditional coupling hardware (Electrical
        Tape, Copper Wiring, Focusing LED) has been staged in the EC Lab across the
        corridor.\n\nAssemble the Light Gun at the central workbench once all components
        are gathered. A direct beam of coherent light will stagger and disrupt the
        entity... even if that entity is me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 300006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab303, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteTitle
      value: "Prof. Anish Mondal \u2014 Final Research Log: Project Lux"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab303, type: 3}
