      value: "September 19 \u2014 23:30 HRS\n\nThe RF spectrum analyzer went completely
        off the scale. Whatever is prowling the second floor emits massive electromagnetic
        disturbances.\n\nProfessor Anish Mondal requested our optical coupling components
        before the corridors were compromised:\n\u2022 Copper Wiring Harnesses from
        our soldering bench\n\u2022 Heavy-duty Insulating Electrical Tape from the
        hardware rack\n\u2022 High-Intensity Focusing LED Diode from the optoelectronics
        bay\n\nCombine these with the optical housing and battery pack in the Mechatronics
        Lab to finish the Light Gun.\n\nBe warned: this room has narrower aisles
        than Mechatronics. If the entity pursues you in here, keep circling the center
        benches!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 300006, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab303, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _noteTitle
      value: 'ECE Technical Log: Anomalous RF Saturation & Light Weapon Coupling'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 7a78c514a6a2f374fbde4d0a3bcab303, type: 3}
